# Turning Show Overdue in Navigator off in the settings window drops the entry from the Navigator for good, while gO still opens the view.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
END
keys g,
see Settings
keys /
type overdue
keys <Enter> <Space> <Esc>
keys <C-g>
see Navigator
hide Overdue
keys <Esc>
restart
keys <C-g>
see Navigator
hide Overdue
keys <Esc> gO
see 󰨱 Overdue
see - Write report  Work
quit
